WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.231
Welcome!

00:00:01.231 --> 00:00:05.096
In this video, we will see School ID from A to Z:

00:00:05.096 --> 00:00:09.277
from installation to sending report cards to parents.

00:00:09.277 --> 00:00:14.483
School ID is the school management software by ISDOU Technologies.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.014
School ID is installed on the school's computer.

00:00:20.014 --> 00:00:22.356
You run install, then start.

00:00:22.356 --> 00:00:27.540
Then each person logs in with their own username and password.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.049
No Internet is needed to work.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:34.199
The dashboard is the first page.

00:00:34.199 --> 00:00:40.879
It shows the number of students, the money collected and what remains to be paid.

00:00:40.879 --> 00:00:46.074
The quick access buttons open the most used pages in one click.

00:00:47.574 --> 00:00:53.826
In the settings, you enter the school's name, logo, phone numbers and school year.

00:00:53.826 --> 00:00:57.410
You add a photo of the stamp and the signature:

00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:00.689
School ID removes the background by itself.

00:01:00.689 --> 00:01:04.196
You also choose the months of the school year.

00:01:05.696 --> 00:01:10.641
You create the classes with their enrolment and tuition fees.

00:01:10.641 --> 00:01:16.477
For subjects, the “Add several subjects” button offers ready-made lists,

00:01:16.477 --> 00:01:20.530
with coefficients and names in English and Arabic.

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:26.447
The enrolment form contains the student, the parents,

00:01:26.447 --> 00:01:30.865
the photo and the parent's phone number for WhatsApp.

00:01:30.865 --> 00:01:37.282
To go faster, you can also enrol a whole list of students from an Excel file.

00:01:38.790 --> 00:01:46.008
The list of students shows, for each one, the class, what has been paid and what remains.

00:01:46.008 --> 00:01:52.739
You search for a student by name or ID number, and each line opens the full record.

00:01:54.239 --> 00:01:59.668
For a payment, you choose the student, then tick the months paid:

00:01:59.668 --> 00:02:03.176
one month, three months or the whole year.

00:02:03.176 --> 00:02:06.434
The amount is calculated automatically.

00:02:06.434 --> 00:02:11.362
The Orange Money, Moov Money or Wave reference is optional.

00:02:12.879 --> 00:02:19.898
The receipt is printed straight away, with the months paid, the total already paid,

00:02:19.898 --> 00:02:23.704
the balance due, the stamp and the signature.

00:02:23.704 --> 00:02:28.778
You can also send it to the parent on WhatsApp in one click.

00:02:30.279 --> 00:02:38.306
School ID prints school cards for students and teachers, with a photo and a QR code.

00:02:38.306 --> 00:02:44.040
Several designs are available, on paper or on plastic cards.

00:02:45.559 --> 00:02:51.620
In the morning, each student shows their card to a phone or an entrance kiosk:

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:54.573
the arrival is recorded automatically.

00:02:54.573 --> 00:02:58.769
The attendance page shows who is absent in each class,

00:02:58.769 --> 00:03:02.344
and an absence message can be sent to parents.

00:03:03.844 --> 00:03:08.683
For marks, you choose the class, the term and the subject,

00:03:08.683 --> 00:03:12.438
then type the class marks and the exam marks.

00:03:12.438 --> 00:03:16.443
Averages and ranks are calculated automatically.

00:03:17.943 --> 00:03:25.817
The report cards of the whole class are printed at once, in French, English or Arabic.

00:03:25.817 --> 00:03:34.150
With “Send to parents”, each report card goes as a PDF to the parent's WhatsApp, by itself,

00:03:34.150 --> 00:03:36.805
about two seconds per parent.

00:03:38.305 --> 00:03:43.199
The sending log keeps proof of every document sent:

00:03:43.199 --> 00:03:47.806
the date, the parent, the number and the result.

00:03:47.806 --> 00:03:53.660
If a sending fails, you see it immediately and send it again.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:59.651
Notices, such as a meeting or a public holiday,

00:03:59.651 --> 00:04:06.435
are printed with the school letterhead and sent to parents on WhatsApp.

00:04:06.435 --> 00:04:11.307
Messages to parents can also be sent automatically.

00:04:12.807 --> 00:04:18.620
The timetables of each class and each teacher are prepared here.

00:04:18.620 --> 00:04:25.251
School ID can ring the bell on time, and warn you when a teacher is late.

00:04:26.767 --> 00:04:29.832
Each secretary has her own account.

00:04:29.832 --> 00:04:33.949
Simple mode shows her only the menus she needs.

00:04:33.949 --> 00:04:41.393
Secretaries can work on their own computers, over the school Wi-Fi, on the same data.

00:04:42.893 --> 00:04:46.859
The principal follows the school from a phone:

00:04:46.859 --> 00:04:52.378
the money collected today, attendance, unpaid fees and messages.

00:04:52.378 --> 00:04:57.034
He sees everything, even when he is not in the office.

00:04:58.534 --> 00:05:07.105
Statistics show, in charts, the number of students, payments by month,

00:05:07.105 --> 00:05:11.023
results by class and attendance.

00:05:11.023 --> 00:05:16.900
The end-of-year report is prepared in one click.

00:05:18.414 --> 00:05:23.264
A backup is made in one click and copied to a USB stick.

00:05:23.264 --> 00:05:24.736
Do it every week:

00:05:24.736 --> 00:05:32.357
if the computer breaks down, everything is put back on a new PC without losing anything.

00:05:33.857 --> 00:05:44.327
Every day, a lesson explains one part of the software, read aloud in French, English or Arabic.

00:05:44.327 --> 00:05:49.728
And the assistant answers questions, for example:

00:05:49.728 --> 00:05:52.814
how do I print report cards?

00:05:54.314 --> 00:05:57.602
That was School ID from A to Z.

00:05:57.602 --> 00:06:00.891
For a free demo at your school,

00:06:00.891 --> 00:06:14.150
write to us on WhatsApp or by SMS at +223 91 90 99 28.

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:17.120
Thank you, and see you soon!
